MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Bob,

Your logging conventions RFC looks great. One addition I'd suggest:

Include request_id as a standard attribute for any log emitted
during HTTP request handling. We can use middleware to inject it
into the context and pull it out via slog.Handler.

This makes it much easier to correlate logs across the SMTP, IMAP,
and web layers when a single user action touches multiple components.

- Dev

