References: <msg009@example.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Feb 2026 14:00:00 +0000
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Bob,

Good catch on the blob GC race condition. I think the right fix is
a combination:

1. Bump grace period to 4 hours (simple, low risk)
2. Add a "replication watermark" -- GC only considers blobs older
   than the oldest un-replicated Raft log entry

Option 2 is more correct but more complex. Let's do option 1 now
and add option 2 to the backlog.

- Dev

